Orange Pi 5 Pro: defconfig from Armbian (orangepi-5 plus eMMC/SDHCI) and the
linux 7.3.5 device tree, with its own copy of the 7.3.5 orangepi-5 dtsi as
the u-boot one is older and shared with the Orange Pi 5 and 5B.

